  "description": "An independent, community .NET port of Vectorize's Python hindsight-agent-framework integration. Gives Microsoft Agent Framework agents long-term memory backed by a Hindsight memory bank: relevant memories are recalled and injected into the agent's instructions before each run, and the run's transcript is retained afterwards, with no MCP server and no tool the model has to remember to call. NOT affiliated with or endorsed by Vectorize AI, Inc. Unrelated to the Hindsight.Behave behaviour-tree package.",
